# Tasteframe environment templates live next to each runtime:
#   apps/api/.env.example  → copy to apps/api/.env       (FastAPI: Qloo, AWS S3, Supabase, session secret)
#   apps/web/.env.example  → copy to apps/web/.env.local (Next.js: API_BASE_URL only)
#
# Quick start:
#   cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
#
# Secrets (QLOO_API_KEY, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, SESSION_SECRET) are API-only. The Supabase
# publishable key is not secret, but it's still only needed by the API. Never prefix them with NEXT_PUBLIC_ and never commit real .env files.
